# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Valida frontend — example environment file
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in local values:
#   Windows PowerShell:  Copy-Item .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored. `.env.example` is committed.
# Governed by 08_FRONTEND_SPEC.md sections 122-125 and
# 15_DEVOPS_DEPLOYMENT.md sections 51-53.
#
# SECURITY RULE (08_FRONTEND_SPEC.md section 124)
# Everything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the browser bundle and is PUBLIC.
# Never place API secrets, storage credentials, the MongoDB URI or email
# provider secrets in this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the Valida backend REST API.
# Consumed from Milestone A5 onward via src/config/env.js.
# Local development example:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# Public origin of the Valida website, used for canonical URLs and metadata.
# Consumed from Milestone A4 onward.
# Local development example:
VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5173
